<h3 class="fadeInUp animatable"><%= department.name %></h3>
<p class="fadeInUp animatable">With the introduction of advanced CT &amp; MRI Services for children and adults of both genders in Neotia Bhagirathi Woman and Child Care Centre, New Town, the range and comprehensiveness of medical services offered has scaled new peaks.</p>
<div class="workup-sec mt-3">
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable speciality_banner_no"><img class="img-fluid speciality_banner" src="/upload/fileManager/specialise_banner/CTMRIScan.png"></li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable first_class">
<div class="mb-2">
<p>To put it simply, world-class diagnostic imaging has now come within the reach of everyone, irrespective of age and gender, albeit with a special focus on paediatric care. Male or female, young or old – there is no restriction on access to these useful medical tools.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<p>The CT &amp; MRI services now available in New Town are not just comprehensive but have other key features that make them among the best in the city. Expert paediatric radiologists are on hand as well along with anaesthesia support.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<p>There are a few more advantages that the CT and MRI services here offer patients.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<p>Firstly, low-dose CT technology is used here which translates into safer diagnostics. Added to this is the facility of high-resolution MRI for brain, spine, abdomen &amp; joints that results in clearer and precise imagery, aiding diagnosis and cure.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<p>And to top it all we ensure accurate reporting that goes a long way in ensuring quicker diagnosis and care.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
